  (polyline (pts (xy 248.00 220.00) (xy 408.00 220.00) (xy 408.00 258.00) (xy 248.00 258.00) (xy 248.00 220.00)) (stroke (width 0.3) (type default)) (uuid "b2278b3b-471f-5ad5-aab4-53daaa1a727d"))
  (text "(1) Instagrid ONE max is the only AC source. Continuous current is 15.7 A.\n(2) Q1 does not switch PE. QF1 is type B, 30 mA.\n(3) F2 is a Schneider GV2L20. NVE41289.09, IEC breaker table, enclosure, 240 V, one phase.\n(4) The row is ATV320U15M2. Line current is 17.8 A at 200 V. Irm is 223 A. Pole 3 is open.\n(5) The sonic feeder is 6 mm2. The terminal maximum is 6 mm2. The S200 feeder is 2.5 mm2.\n(6) F4 feeds the S200 supply. F5 feeds the general 24 V supply. Both continue on the next sheet.\n(7) A crossing without a dot is not a connection.\nNets that leave this sheet are listed on the notes sheet." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 249.60 221.40 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ff658209-4a4d-5c15-8f69-24cdfb5057ed"))
